    "description_en": "A non-physical command-line software tool for connecting to and operating Wasatch spectrometer devices. It is mainly used for experiment debugging, interactive testing, and data acquisition, including device connection, spectrum capture, laser control, dark-spectrum management, interpolated axis setup, and acquisition balancing.",
